      <!-- FINAL -->
      <h2>🙏 Final Thoughts</h2>

      <p>
        Kushinagar is a destination where history, spirituality and
        peaceful surroundings come together. Whether you are visiting
        for a pilgrimage, a historical journey or simply looking for
        a quiet place to explore, Kushinagar can offer a memorable experience.
      </p>

      <p>
        Plan your journey, explore the important sites at your own pace
